---
import SubpageLayout from "../../../layouts/SubpageLayout.astro";
---

<SubpageLayout
  title="时空代数动画 — bionickernel.com"
  description="用 Wolfram 计算 Cl(1,3) 的 boost 转子、reversion 与极分解，manimgl 渲染两条 1080p 动画：Lorentz 收缩与 Wigner 旋转。"
  canonical="https://bionickernel.com/research/sta/"
  active="research"
  eyebrow="Research · 2026-10-20"
  heading="时空代数动画"
  lede="两个垂直 boost 复合后，空间部分做极分解 A = R_W S：S 是收缩，R_W 是 Wigner 旋转。数值全部来自 Wolfram Language 15，动画只做插值。"
  ogTitle="时空代数动画 | bionickernel.com"
  ogDescription="Cl(1,3) boost 转子、reversion 与极分解；两条 1080p 动画演示 Lorentz 收缩与 Wigner 旋转。"
  ogType="article"
>
<style is:global>
  .sta-meta {
    margin-top: 0.85rem;
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    gap: 0.4rem 0.8rem;
    font-family: ui-monospace, SFMono-Regular, Menlo, monospace;
    font-size: 0.72rem;
    color: var(--faint);
  }

  .sta-top {
    margin-top: 1.6rem;
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1.15fr) minmax(280px, 0.85fr);
    gap: 2rem;
    align-items: center;
  }
  .sta-copy p {
    margin-top: 1rem;
    max-width: 42rem;
    color: var(--dim);
    font-size: 0.92rem;
    line-height: 1.85;
    text-wrap: pretty;
  }
  .sta-copy p strong {
    color: var(--fg);
    font-weight: 600;
  }
  .sta-copy code {
    padding: 0.1rem 0.35rem;
    border: 1px solid var(--border);
    border-radius: 5px;
    background: var(--bg-elev);
    font-family: ui-monospace, SFMono-Regular, Menlo, monospace;
    font-size: 0.85em;
    color: var(--fg);
  }

  .sta-formulas {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(2, minmax(0, 1fr));
    gap: 0.55rem;
  }
  .sta-formulas div {
    padding: 0.65rem 0.75rem;
    border: 1px solid var(--line);
    border-radius: 9px;
    background: color-mix(in srgb, var(--bg-elev) 62%, transparent);
  }
  .sta-formulas dt {
    font-family: ui-monospace, SFMono-Regular, Menlo, monospace;
    font-size: 0.63rem;
    letter-spacing: 0.08em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: var(--faint);
  }
  .sta-formulas dd {
    margin: 0.22rem 0 0;
    font-family: ui-monospace, SFMono-Regular, Menlo, monospace;
    font-size: 0.77rem;
    line-height: 1.55;
    color: var(--fg);
    overflow-wrap: anywhere;
  }

  .sta-diagram {
    margin: 0;
    padding: 0.9rem 0.9rem 0.7rem;
    border: 1px solid var(--border);
    border-radius: 14px;
    background:
      radial-gradient(120% 120% at 80% 0%, color-mix(in srgb, var(--accent) 7%, transparent), transparent 60%),
      var(--bg-elev);
  }
  .sta-diagram svg {
    display: block;
    width: 100%;
    height: auto;
  }
  .sta-diagram figcaption {
    margin-top: 0.35rem;
    font-family: ui-monospace, SFMono-Regular, Menlo, monospace;
    font-size: 0.66rem;
    line-height: 1.6;
    color: var(--faint);
  }

  .sta-sec {
    padding: 1.8rem 0 0.2rem;
  }
  .sta-head {
    display: flex;
    align-items: baseline;
    gap: 0.8rem;
    margin-bottom: 0.35rem;
  }
  .sta-head .idx {
    font-family: ui-monospace, SFMono-Regular, Menlo, monospace;
    font-size: 0.7rem;
    letter-spacing: 0.08em;
    color: var(--accent-text);
  }
  .sta-head h2 {
    font-size: 1.12rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    letter-spacing: 0.01em;
    text-transform: none;
    color: var(--fg);
  }
  .sta-sec p {
    max-width: 42rem;
    color: var(--dim);
    font-size: 0.9rem;
    line-height: 1.8;
    text-wrap: pretty;
  }

  .sta-fig {
    margin-top: 1rem;
    border: 1px solid var(--border);
    border-radius: 14px;
    background: #1b1b1b;
    overflow: hidden;
  }
  .sta-figbar {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 0.65rem;
    padding: 0.48rem 0.85rem;
    border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.06);
    font-family: ui-monospace, SFMono-Regular, Menlo, monospace;
    font-size: 0.66rem;
    color: #8f989d;
  }
  .sta-figbar .dot {
    width: 5px;
    height: 5px;
    border-radius: 50%;
    background: #e5b94f;
    flex: none;
  }
  .sta-fig video {
    display: block;
    width: 100%;
    height: auto;
    aspect-ratio: 16 / 9;
    background: #1b1b1b;
  }
  .sta-fig figcaption {
    padding: 0.6rem 0.9rem 0.7rem;
    border-top: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.06);
    font-family: ui-monospace, SFMono-Regular, Menlo, monospace;
    font-size: 0.7rem;
    line-height: 1.7;
    color: #9aa1a6;
  }

  .sta-facts {
    margin: 1rem 0 0;
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(3, minmax(0, 1fr));
    gap: 0.6rem;
    max-width: 46rem;
  }
  .sta-facts div {
    padding: 0.7rem 0.8rem;
    border: 1px solid var(--line);
    border-radius: 9px;
    background: color-mix(in srgb, var(--bg-elev) 55%, transparent);
  }
  .sta-facts dt {
    font-family: ui-monospace, SFMono-Regular, Menlo, monospace;
    font-size: 0.64rem;
    letter-spacing: 0.04em;
    color: var(--faint);
  }
  .sta-facts dd {
    margin: 0.2rem 0 0;
    font-family: ui-monospace, SFMono-Regular, Menlo, monospace;
    font-size: 0.8rem;
    color: var(--fg);
    font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums;
  }

  .sta-note {
    margin-top: 1.6rem;
    max-width: 42rem;
    padding: 0.85rem 1rem;
    border-left: 2px solid var(--accent);
    background: color-mix(in srgb, var(--bg-elev) 72%, transparent);
    color: var(--dim);
    font-size: 0.84rem;
    line-height: 1.8;
  }
  .sta-note code {
    font-family: ui-monospace, SFMono-Regular, Menlo, monospace;
    font-size: 0.85em;
    color: var(--fg);
  }

  .sta-back {
    margin-top: 1.8rem;
    padding-top: 0.9rem;
    border-top: 1px solid var(--line);
  }
  .sta-back a {
    font-family: ui-monospace, SFMono-Regular, Menlo, monospace;
    font-size: 0.72rem;
    color: var(--faint);
    text-decoration: none;
    border-bottom: 1px solid transparent;
  }
  .sta-back a:hover {
    color: var(--fg);
    border-color: currentColor;
  }

  @media (max-width: 900px) {
    .sta-top { grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1fr); gap: 1.2rem; }
    .sta-diagram { max-width: 540px; }
  }
  @media (max-width: 640px) {
    .sta-formulas { grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1fr); }
    .sta-facts { grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1fr); }
    .sta-fig { border-radius: 10px; }
    .sta-fig figcaption { padding: 0.5rem 0.7rem 0.6rem; }
  }
</style>

<p slot="meta" class="sta-meta">
  <span>2026-10-20</span>
  <span>已完成</span>
  <span>Wolfram Language 15</span>
  <span>manimgl 1.7.2</span>
</p>

<div class="sta-top">
  <div class="sta-copy">
    <dl class="sta-formulas">
      <div>
        <dt>signature</dt>
        <dd>γ₀² = 1, γ₁² = γ₂² = γ₃² = −1</dd>
      </div>
      <div>
        <dt>rotor</dt>
        <dd>R = e^(−φ γ₀γ₁ / 2)</dd>
      </div>
      <div>
        <dt>sandwich</dt>
        <dd>v′ = R v R̃</dd>
      </div>
      <div>
        <dt>contraction</dt>
        <dd>L = L₀ / cosh φ</dd>
      </div>
    </dl>
    <p>
      STA 取 <code>Cl(1,3)</code>，boost 转子通过夹心变换作用在几何上；空间长度按
      <code>1 / cosh φ</code> 收缩。两个垂直 boost 复合后再做极分解，旋转部分即
      Wigner/Thomas 旋转。
    </p>
  </div>

  <figure class="sta-diagram">
    <svg viewBox="0 0 360 300" role="img" aria-labelledby="sta-cone-title">
      <title id="sta-cone-title">Minkowski diagram: gamma_1 boosted along the hyperbola x squared minus t squared equals 1</title>
      <polygon points="170,170 82,82 258,82" style="fill:var(--accent);opacity:.05" />
      <line x1="64" y1="170" x2="322" y2="170" style="stroke:var(--faint);stroke-width:1.2" />
      <polygon points="322,166 332,170 322,174" style="fill:var(--faint)" />
      <line x1="170" y1="286" x2="170" y2="58" style="stroke:var(--faint);stroke-width:1.2" />
      <polygon points="166,58 170,48 174,58" style="fill:var(--faint)" />
      <g style="stroke:var(--line-strong);stroke-width:1">
        <line x1="115" y1="166" x2="115" y2="174" />
        <line x1="225" y1="166" x2="225" y2="174" />
        <line x1="166" y1="115" x2="174" y2="115" />
        <line x1="166" y1="225" x2="174" y2="225" />
      </g>
      <g style="stroke:var(--line-strong);stroke-width:1;stroke-dasharray:4 5">
        <line x1="82" y1="258" x2="258" y2="82" />
        <line x1="82" y1="82" x2="258" y2="258" />
      </g>
      <path d="M170 115 L181.1 113.9 L192.6 110.5 L205 104.8 L218.8 96.4 L234.6 85.1 L253 70.4 L274.7 51.7 L300.7 28.2" fill="none" style="stroke:var(--accent);stroke-width:2.2;stroke-linecap:round" />
      <circle cx="170" cy="170" r="2.6" style="fill:var(--fg)" />
      <line x1="170" y1="170" x2="253" y2="70.4" style="stroke:#e5b94f;stroke-width:7;stroke-linecap:round" marker-end="url(#sta-arrow)" />
      <defs>
        <marker id="sta-arrow" viewBox="0 0 10 10" refX="8" refY="5" markerWidth="5.5" markerHeight="5.5" orient="auto-start-reverse">
          <path d="M0,0 L10,5 L0,10 z" fill="#e5b94f" />
        </marker>
      </defs>
      <text x="334" y="174" style="fill:var(--faint);font-size:13px;font-family:ui-monospace,monospace">t</text>
      <text x="176" y="46" style="fill:var(--faint);font-size:13px;font-family:ui-monospace,monospace">x</text>
      <text x="252" y="30" style="fill:var(--faint);font-size:10.5px;font-family:ui-monospace,monospace">x² − t² = 1</text>
      <text x="214" y="112" style="fill:#e5b94f;font-size:11px;font-family:ui-monospace,monospace">γ₁</text>
    </svg>
    <figcaption>γ₁ 的像沿 x² − t² = 1 运动；箭头为 φ = 1.2 时的位置。</figcaption>
  </figure>
</div>

<section class="sta-sec">
  <div class="sta-head">
    <span class="idx">01</span>
    <h2>时空图：夹心变换与尺缩</h2>
  </div>
  <p>黄色箭头是 γ₁ 的像，沿双曲线 x² − t² = 1 运动；绿色杆按 1 / cosh φ 实时收缩。</p>
  <figure class="sta-fig">
    <div class="sta-figbar"><span class="dot"></span><span>1920×1080</span><span>30 fps</span><span>H.264</span><span>18.9 s</span></div>
    <video
      controls
      playsinline
      preload="metadata"
      poster="/assets/research/sta/staspacetime-poster.jpg"
      aria-label="时空代数 boost 动画：转子夹心变换、双曲线轨迹与尺缩"
    >
      <source src="/assets/research/sta/STASpacetime.mp4" type="video/mp4" />
    </video>
    <figcaption>Cl(1,3) boost · φ: 0 → 1.6 · cosh φ 最大 2.58 · 双曲线 x² − t² = 1</figcaption>
  </figure>
</section>

<section class="sta-sec">
  <div class="sta-head">
    <span class="idx">02</span>
    <h2>三维：收缩与 Wigner 旋转</h2>
  </div>
  <p>前段让立方体沿 γ₁ 收缩；后段显示 R₂R₁ 的空间旋转，轴为 z，角度从 0 到 78.7°。</p>
  <figure class="sta-fig">
    <div class="sta-figbar"><span class="dot"></span><span>1920×1080</span><span>30 fps</span><span>H.264</span><span>18.9 s</span></div>
    <video
      controls
      playsinline
      preload="metadata"
      poster="/assets/research/sta/stagraphics-poster.jpg"
      aria-label="时空代数三维动画：线框立方体的 Lorentz 收缩与 Wigner 旋转"
    >
      <source src="/assets/research/sta/STAGraphics.mp4" type="video/mp4" />
    </video>
    <figcaption>R₂R₁ = boost · rotation · R_W 轴为 z · 角度 0 → 78.7°</figcaption>
  </figure>
</section>

<section class="sta-sec">
  <div class="sta-head">
    <span class="idx">03</span>
    <h2>数值校验</h2>
  </div>
  <dl class="sta-facts">
    <div><dt>signature</dt><dd>diag(1, −1, −1, −1)</dd></div>
    <div><dt>R R̃</dt><dd>1</dd></div>
    <div><dt>R_W 正交误差</dt><dd>8.9 × 10⁻¹⁶</dd></div>
    <div><dt>det R_W</dt><dd>1</dd></div>
    <div><dt>S 对称误差</dt><dd>5.3 × 10⁻¹⁵</dd></div>
    <div><dt>Wigner 角（φ = 3）</dt><dd>78.66°</dd></div>
  </dl>
</section>

<p class="sta-note">
  计算与渲染分离：<code>sta.wl</code> 用 WL 的 <code>CliffordAlgebra</code> 计算 rotor、
  reversion、夹心变换和极分解，导出 JSON；<code>sta_scene.py</code> 只插值数值并绘制，
  Python 侧不实现 Clifford 代数。
</p>

<p class="sta-back"><a href="/research/">← 研究索引</a></p>
</SubpageLayout>
